1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,566
Sab kehte hain petrol ka zamaana jaane wala hai. Mera kya hoga?

2
00:00:04,866 --> 00:00:10,885
Aman, to aane wale zamaane ka dhandha kar! Electric gaadiyon ka charging station khol!

3
00:00:11,185 --> 00:00:14,046
Par uncle, abhi electric gaadiyan hain kitni?

4
00:00:14,346 --> 00:00:20,961
E-rickshaw, scooter, har din badh rahe hain! Chhoti gaadiyon ka charging hub, lagbhag 3 lakh mein.

5
00:00:21,261 --> 00:00:26,473
Bijli vibhag se EV connection le, aur app pe apna station list kar.

6
00:00:27,023 --> 00:00:31,437
Bhaiya, meri scooty ki battery 10 percent hai! 20 delivery baaki hain!

7
00:00:31,737 --> 00:00:34,742
Ek ghante mein full. 18 rupaye unit, bas!

8
00:00:35,042 --> 00:00:40,711
Bijli sasti, charging mehngi. Roz 50 gaadiyan, yaani 2 hazaar ki kamai.

9
00:00:41,011 --> 00:00:46,788
Saath mein chai-coffee aur WiFi rakh. Charging ka intezaar, teri extra kamai!

10
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:50,013
Petrol gaya, current aaya! Aman ki life set!
